# Core standards

- Keep changes minimal and focused on the requested task
- Match existing file formats in `.cursor/rules/`, `.cursor/skills/`, and `.cursor/hooks/`
- Do not add dependencies or build tooling unless explicitly requested
- Document new Cursor config in README.md when adding user-facing behavior
- Prefer complete sentences in markdown docs; avoid telegraphic bullet chains
